 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hey, how are you doing?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_01"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Honestly, a little stressed, but okay.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.4,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My sixteen-year-old is impossible to wake up. School starts at eight.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.42,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Teens' body clocks genuinely shift later, so it's not just laziness. They often can't feel sleepy before eleven.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 1.75,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "So what do I do?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Let him sleep till noon?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.78,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "On school days, help him get to bed a little earlier by putting screens away at ten, and open the curtains as soon as he wakes.",
   "est_sec": 8.16,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hang on, I missed that.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.49,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_04",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Of course. On school days, help him get to bed a little earlier by putting screens away at ten, and open the curtains as soon as he wakes.",
   "est_sec": 8.78,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "He'll hate that.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Probably. Explain the why, teens respond better when they understand it. And keep weekend lie-ins to an hour or two longer, not until afternoon.",
   "est_sec": 7.54,
   "gap_before": 0.8,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "An hour or two. Okay, that's fair.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.83,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg13"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "And breakfast with some protein helps him actually feel awake.",
